10:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-page__inner","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"prose-page__nav","aria-label":"Site","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/","className":"prose-page__home","children":"Tashfeen Ahmed"}],["$","nav",null,{"children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/process","children":"Process"}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/writing","children":"Writing"}]]}]]}],["$","main",null,{"children":["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"prose-page__kicker","children":"Process"}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"How I design human-AI interfaces"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"prose-page__lede","children":"The case studies on this site each describe one project. Read together, they describe one way of working. This page gathers it in one place, with a link back to the project each step came from."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"At Microsoft I work at the intersection of AI and design, balancing what people need with the fast-advancing capabilities of AI. The steps below are not a framework I picked up. They are the moves that recur across the work, from Copilot in Word and Agent Mode back through the research and hardware projects that came before them."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"prose-page__steps","children":[["$","li","Start where people already work",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Start where people already work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The capability goes into the tool the person already has open, not into a new one. Copilot in Word helps people draft, summarize, rewrite and edit documents with conversational agents, all within the familiar Word environment. pyReality put mixed reality data visualization directly inside Jupyter Notebooks so an analyst never had to switch platforms for modelling, rendering and viewing. My own MIDI controller plugged straight into Rekordbox rather than asking me to change how I perform."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"prose-page__source","children":["From:"," ",[["$","span","/#copilot-introMicrosoft Copilot",{"children":[false,["$","a",null,{"href":"/#copilot-intro","children":"Microsoft Copilot"}]]}],["$","span","/#pyreality-intropyReality",{"children":[", ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/#pyreality-intro","children":"pyReality"}]]}],["$","span","/#midi-controller-introMIDI Controller",{"children":[", ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/#midi-controller-intro","children":"MIDI Controller"}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","li","Map the system before designing the interface",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Map the system before designing the interface"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Before moving forward on the KeepTruckin developer platform, I investigated how it would affect the workflows that already existed in the App Marketplace. I mapped the current environment, drew high-level user flows for the new end-to-end journey from app creation and testing to publication, and split the project into phases so each change could be checked before the next. The same habit applies to an AI feature: know what the person does today before deciding what the agent should do for them."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"prose-page__source","children":["From:"," ",[["$","span","/#keeptruckin-introMotive / KeepTruckin",{"children":[false,["$","a",null,{"href":"/#keeptruckin-intro","children":"Motive / KeepTruckin"}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","li","Interview the people it is for, and keep them in the loop",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Interview the people it is for, and keep them in the loop"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"On KeepTruckin I interviewed developers, identified their pain points and validated assumptions through regular feedback sessions. On Fidget Digits we ran semi-structured interviews with ten students before sketching anything, and feedback from users was taken at every step of the design process. The interviews are where the surprising constraints come from: those students preferred a handheld tracker to a wearable, which shaped the whole device."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b"]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}]}],"$L21"]}]}],["$L22"],"$L23"]}]
